<div class="container mt-5">
  <div class="text-center">
    <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold">About Us</h1>
    <p class="lead mt-3 mb-5">
      At Dino Desks, we believe that workspaces should inspire creativity, productivity, and comfort. 
      Whether you're a freelancer, entrepreneur, or part of a remote team, our goal is to help you 
      find the perfect spot to work from anywhere.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Image Section -->
  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="d-flex">
      <img src="<%= asset_path('about_image1.jpg') %>" class="img-fluid" style="width: 50%; height: 400px; object-fit: cover;" alt="Work Environment">
      <img src="<%= asset_path('about_image2.jpg') %>" class="img-fluid" style="width: 50%; height: 400px; object-fit: cover;" alt="Remote Work">
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- What We Offer Section -->
  <div class="mt-5">
    <h2 class="fw-bold text-center mb-4">What We Offer</h2>
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-md-4 text-center mb-4">
        <h5 class="fw-bold">A Wide Selection of Workspaces</h5>
        <p class="text-muted">
          From cozy cafes and libraries to innovative co-working spaces and tranquil retreats, our listings are carefully selected 
          to suit diverse working styles and preferences.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-4 text-center mb-4">
        <h5 class="fw-bold">Detailed Information at Your Fingertips</h5>
        <p class="text-muted">
          We provide extensive details about each listing, including amenities, opening hours, noise levels, internet speed, 
          and reviews from fellow remote workers.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-4 text-center mb-4">
        <h5 class="fw-bold">Community Insights</h5>
        <p class="text-muted">
          Gain insights from a community of remote workers. Read reviews, tips, and recommendations to make informed decisions 
          about your next remote work location.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

<!-- Mission Section -->
<div class="text-center mt-5">
  <h2 class="fw-bold">Our Mission</h2>
  <div class="mx-auto" style="max-width: 700px;">
    <p class="mt-3">
      Our mission is simple: to connect remote workers with spaces that are not just places to work, but environments that enhance productivity, creativity, and work-life balance. We believe that the right setting can transform the work experience, making it more enjoyable, efficient, and fulfilling.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

  <!-- Call to Action -->
  <div class="text-center mt-5">
    <h3 class="fw-bold">Want to contribute?</h3>
    <p>Know a great spot? Add it to our platform and help others find their next favorite workspace.</p>
    <a href="/new/work_location" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Add a Location</a>
  </div>
</div>
